#: ../../getting_started/guides/autoinstall_instance.rst:367
msgid ""
"To begin provisioning, navigate to :menuselection:`Provisioning --> "
"Instances` and click :guilabel:`+ ADD`. From the list of Instance Types, "
"select the \"SUITE_CRM\" Instance Type we just created, click "
